<title>USA: Jerry's Famous Deli to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Jerry's Famous Deli to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>STUDIO CITY, Calif. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jerry's Famous Deli Tuesday said it plans to buy back up to 400,000 shares of common stock in open market transactions.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said it currently has 10,386,250 shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
